---
// Slide 04 — "Conversations under one roof". The Messages screen.
// Floating: search, two message rows, compose. Pinned: nav bar.
// Numbers transcribed from live-mockup-files/index.html §Messages.
//
// This screen has the least scroll runway of the four (~39px): its source is
// 852 units against a 618px viewport. Homing still fires, there is just little
// travel — that is the export, not a porting bug.
